- "<h1 id=\"link-types\">Link Types</h1>\n<h2 id=\"external\">External</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://example.com</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/bottd/mog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mog on GitHub</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"document-references\">Document References</h2>\n<p><a href=\"recipe.html\">recipe</a> <a href=\"docs/readme.html\">Readme</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"heading-references\">Heading References</h2>\n<p><a href=\"#link-types\">Back to the top</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"footnotes\">Footnotes</h2>\n<p>A good marinara starts with San Marzano tomatoes<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-1\">1</a></sup>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixed-content\">Mixed Content</h2>\n<p>This paragraph has a <a href=\"https://rust-lang.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rust website</a> and a <a href=\"tutorial.html\">tutorial document</a>.</p>\n<aside class=\"footnotes\"><ol><li id=\"footnote-1\">A fruit, not a vegetable <a href=\"#footnote-ref-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">&#x21a9;</a></li></ol></aside>\n"
